sequenceDiagram
    actor P1 as Participant 1
    actor P2 as Participant 2
    actor E as Employer
    participant AsS as AssignmentService
    participant DB as SQL Server
    P1->>AsS: JoinChallengeAsync(acceptedTerms=true)
    AsS->>DB: count < MaxParticipants? INSERT assignment, update job ConcurrencyStamp
    P2->>AsS: JoinChallengeAsync(acceptedTerms=true)
    P2->>AsS: SubmitAsync → SubmittedAt = t1
    P1->>AsS: SubmitAsync → SubmittedAt = t2 (t2 > t1)
    E->>AsS: ApproveAsync(P1 submission)
    AsS-->>E: refused — earliest pending submission must be reviewed first
    E->>AsS: RejectChallengeSubmissionAsync(P2 submission, reason)
    AsS->>DB: P2 submission=Rejected, P2 may resubmit before deadline
    E->>AsS: ApproveAsync(P1 submission)
    AsS->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    AsS->>DB: check WinnerAssignmentId IS NULL, set winner, IsWinner=1 (unique filtered index)
    AsS->>DB: other participants=ChallengeLost, pending submissions=Closed
    AsS->>DB: INSERT Payment(winner, Approved)
    AsS->>DB: COMMIT (concurrency stamp prevents a second winner)
